menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-782\"><a title=\"Key things\" href=\"/key-things/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Key things</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-781\" class=\"nav-item menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-781\"><a title=\"Tips &#038; Advice\" href=\"/tips-advice/\" class=\"dropdown-item\">Tips &#038; Advice</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div>\n            </nav>\n                </div>\n        </div>\n\t</div><!-- #masthead -->\n\n\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t<div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area col-sm-12 col-lg-12\">\n\t\t<div id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\" style=\"position: relative;\">\n\n\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-664\" class=\"post-664 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\" >\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mainimg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/discussion1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive mb-4 d-none d-md-block\" />\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<h1 class=\"colored page-title\">Developing Your Talent</h1>\t\t<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n<p>Join us and we will help you to be even better at what you do through our learning and development support.</p>\n<p>We assist our people so they can deliver great work. We provide support through smart working, adopting best practice, deploying the latest technology and through ongoing personal development that is designed to help you stay at the top of your game. </p>\n<p>Whichever area you work in you will have every opportunity to develop your skills to the full and really make a difference.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\n<p>Your training includes an Induction Programme, ongoing practical training, mentorship from your manager and even the opportunity to pursue professional qualifications in some areas.</p>\n<p>In 2019 we are deepening our development offer so that managers and staff can access leading edge on-line learning to help them perform better.</p>\n<p>As part of the team you will always be surrounded by great professionals committed to collaborative working who can share experiences and expertise and help you develop.</p>\n<h1 class=\"colored\">Quite simply, at Kyowa Kirin International you will have every chance to progress &#8211; and keep on progressing.</h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\n\n</article><!-- #post-## -->\n\t\t</div><!-- #main -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"p-0 col-12 col-md-12  border border-white\">\n\t\t\t\t<section id=\"text-3\" class=\"widget widget_text\">\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><div class=\"card-deck ml-0 mr-0 mt-4\">\n<div id=\"box1\" class=\"card shadow bg-white rounded animated bounceInLeft mb-3\">\n<div style=\"min-height: 1%;\"><a href=\"/about/\"><img class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/about-us-bottom.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"card-body d-flex flex-column\">\n<h1 class=\"card-title\">About Us</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"card-text\"><a href=\"/about/\">We are focused on building a Global…</a></p>\n<p class=\"card-text mt-auto\"><small class=\"text-muted morelink\"><a href=\"/about/\">READ MORE</a></small></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"box2\" class=\"card shadow bg-white rounded animated bounceInLeft mb-3\">\n<div style=\"min-height: 1%;\"><a href=\"/our-values/\"><img class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/our-values-bottom.png\" alt=\"Card image cap\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"card-body d-flex flex-column\">\n<h1 class=\"card-title\">Our Values</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"card-text\"><a href=\"/our-values/\">Find out what we do and why…</a></p>\n<p class=\"card-text mt-auto\"><small class=\"text-muted morelink\"><a href=\"/our-values/\">READ MORE</a></small></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"box3\" class=\"card shadow bg-white rounded 